# Linux 容器部署：shell/Docker/YAML 必须保持 LF，否则 entrypoint.sh 在容器里会因 \r 报错
* text=auto
*.sh          text eol=lf
Dockerfile    text eol=lf
*.py          text eol=lf
*.yml         text eol=lf
*.yaml        text eol=lf
*.md          text eol=lf
requirements.txt text eol=lf
*.ps1         text eol=crlf
*.bat         text eol=crlf
